      <title>&#39;PM&#39; (15x15, Themed)</title>
      <link>https://wyatt-johnston.com/crossword/pm/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://wyatt-johnston.com/crossword/pm/</guid>
      <description>&lt;!-- Include the CryptoJS library for hashing the user id before sending it to the PuzzleMe server. --&gt;
&lt;script src=&#34;https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/crypto-js/4.1.1/crypto-js.min.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;!-- Include the javascript library for embedding this puzzle. --&gt;
&lt;script id=&#34;pm-script&#34; src=&#34;https://puzzleme.amuselabs.com/pmm/js/puzzleme-embed.js&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;!-- Specify the Amuse Labs server name from where the puzzles will be served and trigger the embed flow. --&gt;
&lt;script&gt;
    PM_Config.PM_BasePath = &#34;https://puzzleme.amuselabs.com/pmm/&#34;;
&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;!-- Specifies the puzzle to be embedded on the page. --&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;pm-embed-div&#34; data-id=&#34;6de5205d&#34; data-set=&#34;c0222f5f40b2d9e49384cab67275a3c0d9743346901697b4e3e418f49e841e17&#34; data-puzzletype=&#34;crossword&#34; data-height=&#34;700px&#34; data-mobilemargin=&#34;10px&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;


You can also download the grid below as a PDF
&lt;a href=&#34;https://wyatt-johnston.com/crosswords/PM.pdf&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;,
or as a .puz file
&lt;a href=&#34;https://wyatt-johnston.com/crosswords/PM.puz&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.


&lt;div style=&#34;text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;button id=&#34;show-solution-btn&#34; style=&#34;padding: 0.5rem 1rem; cursor: pointer;&#34;&gt;Show Solution&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&#34;solution-container&#34; style=&#34;display: none; text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://wyatt-johnston.com/crosswords/PM_solution.png&#34; alt=&#34;Crossword Solution&#34; style=&#34;display: block; margin: auto; width: 100%; max-width: 400px;&#34;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;script&gt;
  const btn = document.getElementById(&#34;show-solution-btn&#34;);
  const solution = document.getElementById(&#34;solution-container&#34;);

  btn.addEventListener(&#34;click&#34;, () =&gt; {
    if (solution.style.display === &#34;none&#34;) {
      solution.style.display = &#34;block&#34;;
      btn.textContent = &#34;Hide Solution&#34;;
    } else {
      solution.style.display = &#34;none&#34;;
      btn.textContent = &#34;CLICK HERE TO SHOW SOLUTION&#34;;
    }
  });
&lt;/script&gt;</description>
    </item>
